WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The saved reading index contains no Week 17 assignment rows, and the saved Moodle Weekend 17 section is empty. The weekly plan describes the summative assessment format but does not name additional book chapters or page ranges.
已保存的阅读索引中没有第17周指定阅读条目，Moodle第17周单元也为空。周计划描述了总结性考核形式，但未列出额外教材章节或页码。

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.072
This does not prove that the instructor assigned no other reading through email, class or a separate platform. Confirm any newer instruction directly with the school instead of treating a missing index entry as a complete school reading list.
这并不能证明教师没有通过邮件、课堂或其他平台布置额外阅读。应直接向学校确认是否有新要求，不要把索引缺项当作完整阅读清单。

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:43.560
Use short retrieval rounds rather than passive rereading: close the book, explain one assessment sequence, one alternative explanation and one reassessment decision, then reopen the source to correct your gaps.
可采用短时主动回忆，而不是被动重读：合上书，讲出一套评估顺序、一种替代解释和一个复评决策，再打开资料纠正遗漏。

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:55.680
Keep the source edition and page beside each correction. A final review should reveal what you still need to ask or practise, not produce a false impression that a summary replaced the assigned materials.
每处修正都应注明来源版本和页码。最后复习应帮助发现仍需询问或练习的内容，而不是造成摘要已替代指定资料的错觉。
